PS2Recomp also fetches ELFIO (MIT), toml11 (MIT), rabbitizer (MIT),
nlohmann/json (MIT), sse2neon (MIT), Dear ImGui and rlImGui (MIT) for its
recompiler and studio. They are build tools here and are not linked into
reo_recomp.exe.

Reference-only tools: PCSX2 (GPL-3.0+) has been run as a black box to capture
GS dumps and memory for comparison. tools/gs_dump_replay reads PCSX2's .gs dump
format; that is format compatibility, and GPL-3.0 here covers it either way.

Not distributed, ever: game code or data, recompiled/generated source, BIOS
images, or anything captured from a running game (REPO_RULES section 3).
